-- colours: ANSI sequences set styles, the text stays plain
-- coloured line (lines 1, top 0, follow 1)
plain red green blue end






'red' is red: 1, plain stays plain: 1
'green' is green and bold: 1 1
'blue' has a blue background: 1, the space after 'green' is plain again: 1
'end' is back to normal: 1
plain red green blue end
orange truecolor junk mo





256: 20000d0, truecolor: 1010203
-- with ansi off the escape characters are skipped but colours are not applied
plain red green blue end
orange truecolor junk mo
not red




